Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.24,0:00:09.04,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,There was once a demon more terrifying \Nand evil than Demon King Ahriman.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.04,0:00:14.67,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,If someone made him angry, humans, demons,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.67,0:00:18.04,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,and entire countries would be \Nutterly destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.52,0:00:22.10,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,He was considered an\Nunstoppable living calamity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.42,0:00:26.01,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,The previous demon king, known \Nas the King of Destruction...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.63,0:00:29.84,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,His name is Zareth!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.08,0:02:07.98,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,"The Previous Demon King Is Too Scary!!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.12,0:02:07.98,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,THE PREVIOUS DEMON KING IS TOO SCARY!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.92,0:02:12.68,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,My father, the previous demon king Zareth,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.68,0:02:17.47,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,is about to celebrate \Nhis 10,000th birthday...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.47,0:02:18.74,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.54,0:02:23.61,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,My father was feared as \Nthe King of Destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.61,0:02:25.49,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,If he comes here and \Nsees Doux like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.78,0:02:32.00,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Th-That would not be good, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.34,0:02:34.25,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,So you think so, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.47,0:02:36.07,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.59,0:02:39.87,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You've left me in charge \Nof Lady Doux's education,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.87,0:02:42.84,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,and yet, she still remains too kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.24,0:02:44.64,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.12,0:02:48.56,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Doux is just too kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.94,0:02:51.12,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,If all else fails, please \Nallow me to take her
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.12,0:02:53.65,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,on a special trial:\Na demon social studies trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.71,0:03:02.41,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,DEMON SOCIAL STUDIES TRIP
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.65,0:02:55.83,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Demon social studies trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.83,0:02:57.09,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I will have Lady Doux
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.09,0:03:01.53,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,witness the atrocities of several \Nevil demons over several days.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.53,0:03:02.41,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Oho!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.41,0:03:07.56,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Then Lady Doux will be influenced \Nby the other demons' hearts
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.56,0:03:10.18,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,and shall awaken to her own evil heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.75,0:03:13.58,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,A demon social studies trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.58,0:03:19.22,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I will have you learn what \Nexactly demons are on this trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.47,0:03:21.84,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,This is a special trial just for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.17,0:03:23.97,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Special!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.65,0:03:27.68,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,These are trapping specialists.\N They are called goblins.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.28,0:03:32.71,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,It is their job to capture the humans \Nthat we use in the demon world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.71,0:03:35.44,Default,GOBLIN A,0,0,0,,Humans will be coming \Nthrough here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.68,0:03:38.19,Default,GOBLIN A,0,0,0,,Try capturing one, Lady Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.19,0:03:40.09,Default,GOBLIN A,0,0,0,,You can use any method you please,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.09,0:03:41.57,Default,GOBLIN A,0,0,0,,but you should try beating them to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.57,0:03:44.06,Default,GOBLIN A,0,0,0,,soften them up for capture.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.06,0:03:45.70,Default,GOBLIN A,0,0,0,,It's fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.70,0:03:52.28,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Goblins are some of the cruelest \Nto humans out of all demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.63,0:03:58.09,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,If she sees that, I'm sure the evil \Nheart within Lady Doux will awaken!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.45,0:04:02.30,Default,GOBLIN A,0,0,0,,Here they come! Get 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.36,0:04:08.06,Default,GOBLIN A,0,0,0,,Hurt them!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.06,0:04:10.01,Default,CHILD A,0,0,0,,I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.01,0:04:11.70,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.32,0:04:15.86,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I caught a human!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.69,0:04:19.95,Default,GOBLIN A,0,0,0,,Er, good! Well done, Lady Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.95,0:04:22.70,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Again! I wanna do that again!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.70,0:04:26.33,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Next, I'm gonna catch some goblins!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.33,0:04:27.45,Default,GOBLIN A,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.12,0:04:31.07,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Humans! Let's catch them together!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.07,0:04:31.95,Default,CHILDREN,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.45,0:04:34.18,Default,GOBLIN A,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.18,0:04:36.79,Default,GOBLIN A,0,0,0,,We don't have time to \Nwaste on such nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.79,0:04:38.31,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,A FEW MINUTES LATER
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.79,0:04:42.28,Default,DOUX/CHILDREN,0,0,0,,Catch them!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.67,0:04:45.59,Default,GOBLINS,0,0,0,,Run away! Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.59,0:04:49.00,Default,GOBLIN A,0,0,0,,Playing is more fun than beating!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.95,0:04:51.68,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,They are black magicians.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.06,0:04:54.83,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Black maggie-shuns...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.83,0:04:57.56,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,They are demons who use magic
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.56,0:04:59.82,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,to create calamities and \Nillnesses to make humans suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.71,0:05:05.51,Default,MAGICIAN A,0,0,0,,We were just about to cast \Na spell on a nearby village.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.51,0:05:10.08,Default,MAGICIAN A,0,0,0,,We'll teach you a spell that will make \Nyour hair stand on end, Lady Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.66,0:05:12.54,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.01,0:05:18.67,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Torturing humans with various spells \Nbrings black magicians the utmost joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.04,0:05:22.30,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,I'm sure if Lady Doux \Nsees that, she'll also...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.82,0:05:25.69,Default,MAGICIAN A,0,0,0,,Now, let us cast the spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.94,0:05:27.93,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,A FEW MINUTES LATER
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.93,0:05:30.68,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Jelly... beans?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.68,0:05:34.12,Default,MAGICIAN A,0,0,0,,No, no! This letter is "zue."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.12,0:05:36.07,Default,MAGICIAN A,0,0,0,,It's "Zuraibe Leusa."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.13,0:05:39.11,Default,MAGICIAN B,0,0,0,,You're so funny, Lady Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.11,0:05:41.90,Default,MAGICIAN B,0,0,0,,It's gonna take her five days \Nto learn a single page.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.14,0:05:46.35,Default,MAGICIAN A,0,0,0,,But this might be more \Nfun than cursing people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.39,0:05:52.16,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,This is a death plant. They devour \Nhumans down to their bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.16,0:05:55.49,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,We feed humans who defy demons to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.91,0:05:59.17,Default,GARDEN DEMON A,0,0,0,,The death plants are \Nespecially voracious today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.17,0:06:01.98,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,If she hears the pitiful \Nscreams of the humans
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.98,0:06:04.63,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,being melted down to their \Nbones by a death plant,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.63,0:06:05.80,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,I'm sure she'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.32,0:06:08.93,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,A FEW MINUTES LATER
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.17,0:06:11.56,Default,GARDEN DEMON A,0,0,0,,Hey! Stop playing around!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.56,0:06:14.06,Default,GARDEN DEMON A,0,0,0,,Your job is to eat humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.63,0:06:22.82,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.18,0:06:25.10,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.63,0:06:26.50,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Hup!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.38,0:06:30.74,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Take that and that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.39,0:06:38.12,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.96,0:06:42.49,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yay! I hit them! I hit them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.87,0:06:46.11,Default,MOUNTAIN MAN A,0,0,0,,That's it, Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.59,0:06:51.22,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.71,0:06:56.93,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Demons are supposed to be evil
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.93,0:07:00.05,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,and yet, they keep falling\Nto Lady Doux's pleasant nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.75,0:07:03.23,Default,SETIA,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.23,0:07:06.09,Default,SETIA,0,0,0,,So that's why you came to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.10,0:07:08.35,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.89,0:07:12.12,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You're the only one I can rely \Non at this point, Lady Setia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.51,0:07:15.99,Default,SETIA,0,0,0,,Goodness, how pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.99,0:07:18.65,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Are mermaids demons, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.65,0:07:22.94,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Mermaids are demons who lure \Nin sailors with their song.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.39,0:07:25.13,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,We get to sing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.73,0:07:27.00,Default,SETIA,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.30,0:07:30.62,Default,SETIA,0,0,0,,Humans whose hearts are \Ncaptivated by our song
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.62,0:07:32.63,Default,SETIA,0,0,0,,willingly throw themselves into the sea
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.07,0:07:35.74,Default,SETIA,0,0,0,,and sink to the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.79,0:08:05.41,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Big Sister Jahi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.04,0:08:12.17,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Oh no! My mind's weakened, so I've \Nbeen affected by the cursed song...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.17,0:08:13.85,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.85,0:08:15.18,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.18,0:08:18.64,Default,SETIA,0,0,0,,Oh? Looks like a ship has \Nshown up at the perfect time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.03,0:08:21.06,Default,SETIA,0,0,0,,Now, come sing with me, Lady Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.54,0:08:22.77,Default,SETIA,0,0,0,,Let's sing the cursed song.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.77,0:08:23.64,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.92,0:08:52.21,Default,SAILORS,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.92,0:08:54.41,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.92,0:08:54.69,top,DOUX,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.69,0:08:58.68,Default,SETIA,0,0,0,,Doux's song is so soothing for the soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.68,0:09:00.06,Default,SETIA,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.58,0:09:02.58,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Even Lady Setia...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.60,0:09:07.14,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Why does this {\i1}always{\i0} happen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.67,0:09:11.19,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Papa! I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.19,0:09:13.82,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Ah, you're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.82,0:09:16.68,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,How many special trials did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.68,0:09:17.93,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Seven!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.93,0:09:20.01,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I see, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.01,0:09:23.43,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Well, Jahi? Has there \Nfinally been some progress?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.97,0:09:26.51,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,As I feared...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.02,0:09:29.46,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I have failed as Lady Doux's attendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.99,0:09:33.91,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,We had her accompany various \Ndemons performing heinous deeds,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.59,0:09:38.22,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,but there has been no progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.47,0:09:42.72,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,That's not true! I'm sure \NDoux has changed as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.24,0:09:46.87,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Doux? How \Nwere the special trials?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.87,0:09:48.44,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,What did you think of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.44,0:09:49.87,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Um, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.87,0:09:55.36,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I thought I wanted to be \Nmore like the other demons!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.74,0:09:59.79,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.79,0:10:01.82,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Is that so, Doux?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.82,0:10:02.87,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.87,0:10:05.00,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Isn't that great, Jahi?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.00,0:10:06.12,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.25,0:10:10.50,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,All of my troubles until now \Nhave finally become worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.50,0:10:13.84,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Now I'll be able to face my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.84,0:10:17.59,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Because everyone was so nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.34,0:10:19.22,Default,JAHI/AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.22,0:10:23.95,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I want to take care of my \Nfriends like the goblins...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.47,0:10:30.35,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,The black maggie-shuns helped \Nme learn some new words...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.35,0:10:35.61,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I want to sing pretty \Nsongs like the mermaids...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.05,0:10:38.99,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Then there's Big Sister Jahi \Nwho's always really nice
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.99,0:10:43.87,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,and always with me as she \Ngives me trials to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.87,0:10:47.41,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux wants to be a demon \Njust like all of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.72,0:10:53.23,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I'm... nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.67,0:10:55.13,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Me...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.13,0:10:57.91,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,No, Doux... You've got it all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.38,0:11:00.61,Default,GARDEN DEMON A,0,0,0,,Pardon me, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.13,0:11:02.19,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.19,0:11:04.70,Default,GARDEN DEMON A,0,0,0,,Lord Zareth has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.70,0:11:05.51,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.87,0:11:10.89,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,But he wasn't supposed to arrive yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.68,0:11:34.00,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,"The Previous Demon King Is Too \NMuch of a Doting Grandpa!!"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.14,0:11:34.00,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,THE PREVIOUS DEMON KING IS TOO MUCH OF A DOTING GRANDPA!!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.87,0:11:40.76,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.79,0:11:46.83,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,You should've told us that you were \Narriving early so we could greet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.25,0:11:49.64,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,No need.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.95,0:11:53.12,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,It's been a while, Ahriman.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.12,0:11:57.52,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,I hadn't been able to return to the \Ncastle after hurting my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.75,0:12:01.58,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Nor have I been able to \Nadvise you properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.01,0:12:03.78,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.78,0:12:06.73,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,No, no, that's no problem at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.73,0:12:08.61,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,It is a pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.61,0:12:10.86,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I am Jahi the attendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.86,0:12:12.91,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming all this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.13,0:12:15.10,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You must be tired from your long journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.48,0:12:17.02,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Allow me to show you to your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.02,0:12:18.10,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,That can wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.10,0:12:18.92,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.92,0:12:22.67,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,More importantly... where's Doux?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.07,0:12:26.55,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,D-Did you need to see \NDoux for some reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.55,0:12:30.02,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,I'm asking you where the \Nnext demon king who has
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.02,0:12:33.31,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,strayed from the path to\Nbecoming a proper demon is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.31,0:12:36.31,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,L-L-Lady Doux is in her room...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.57,0:12:40.44,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I have to hurry! I have to hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.84,0:12:44.38,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,The next demon king must not \Nbe allowed to stray from the path
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.38,0:12:46.41,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,of becoming a proper demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.82,0:12:49.52,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Are her surroundings causing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.52,0:12:52.70,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Is it because you're both spoiling her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.95,0:12:55.99,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,I came here early to eradicate
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.99,0:13:01.45,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,whatever is getting in the way \Nof Doux becoming a proper demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.82,0:13:03.22,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,That is my purpose!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.70,0:13:05.37,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Th-This is bad, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.37,0:13:07.47,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.85,0:13:11.47,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Is this Doux's room?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.47,0:13:14.42,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,P-Please wait, Lord Zareth!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.42,0:13:18.48,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,F-Father, I'm sure that Doux must \Nneed to mentally prepare herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.91,0:13:21.96,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,So please go to the room we've \Nprepared for you for now...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.96,0:13:24.11,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,You're hiding something, aren't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.42,0:13:25.86,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Let me see her at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.41,0:13:36.33,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Ah! It's Pawpaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.15,0:13:38.83,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Pawpaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.09,0:13:40.64,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Pawpaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.64,0:13:44.27,italics,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Doux! It's been too long!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.27,0:13:45.47,italics,ZARETH,0,0,0,,You've gotten so big!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.47,0:13:48.47,italics,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Come, let me hold you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.55,0:13:54.22,italics,ZARETH,0,0,0,,O-Oh no. I almost forgot why I came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.62,0:13:59.98,italics,ZARETH,0,0,0,,That's right. If I spoil her as well, \NDoux will never become a proper demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.46,0:14:04.21,italics,ZARETH,0,0,0,,She will not be able to survive \Nthis cruel demon world!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.98,0:14:02.59,top,DOUX,0,0,0,,Pawpaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.98,0:14:07.73,italics,ZARETH,0,0,0,,You must be the demon \Nthat you are, Zareth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.73,0:14:11.66,italics,ZARETH,0,0,0,,You must be cruel to set \NDoux on the right path!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.61,0:14:16.84,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,I will find out what is hindering \NDoux from becoming a proper demon
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.84,0:14:18.92,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,and eradicate it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.36,0:14:27.61,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,"HEY, PAWPAW"\NLYRICS: KANATA NAKAMURA\N COMPOSITION AND ARRANGEMENT: RYOTA TESHIMA\NSONG: DOUX
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.20,0:14:35.29,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, Pawpaw
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.62,0:14:42.38,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, Pawpaw
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.73,0:14:46.23,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Look, look, the weather outside
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.37,0:14:49.76,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Is just like how I feel
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.95,0:14:53.45,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Mr. Sun is smiling
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.45,0:14:57.02,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Because I get to be with Pawpaw
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.14,0:15:00.52,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,I wanna hold your hands
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.62,0:15:04.11,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Can I hold your hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.21,0:15:08.61,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,They're so cold yet so warm
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.72,0:15:12.24,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,My Pawpaw's hands
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.29,0:15:22.18,italics,ZARETH,0,0,0,,I see. So Doux starts off \Nher days with a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.91,0:15:24.92,italics,ZARETH,0,0,0,,She walks through nature,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.92,0:15:28.73,italics,ZARETH,0,0,0,,picking up acorns, and \Ncollecting fallen leaves...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.36,0:15:34.53,italics,ZARETH,0,0,0,,This must be why she's \Nbecome such a kind child.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.53,0:15:36.37,italics,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Wait, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.37,0:15:38.52,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Walks are unnecessary!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.00,0:15:42.90,italics,ZARETH,0,0,0,,I was about to let Doux's \Nsmile sway me yet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.25,0:15:45.48,italics,ZARETH,0,0,0,,I'm accompanying Doux so I can set her
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.48,0:15:48.84,italics,ZARETH,0,0,0,,on the correct path away \Nfrom these peaceful habits!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.84,0:15:53.01,italics,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Do not forget your mission, me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.33,0:15:59.15,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Why haven't you realized that this walk \Nitself is causing Doux to be so kind?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.53,0:16:01.16,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Make her stop at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.16,0:16:03.50,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,B-But, but, Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.50,0:16:05.52,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Pawpaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.52,0:16:10.15,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I made you a bed, Pawpaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.15,0:16:13.06,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Take a nap here, Pawpaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.06,0:16:15.23,italics,ZARETH,0,0,0,,S-So precious!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.54,0:16:17.46,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.82,0:16:21.00,italics,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Wait, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.48,0:16:24.83,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,You must resist the temptation, me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.23,0:16:27.67,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.67,0:16:29.43,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,This is our quarry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.43,0:16:32.42,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,We make the enslaved humans work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.98,0:16:37.80,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.05,0:16:40.31,Default,ADULT C,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.31,0:16:44.69,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Er, Lady Doux! Why are you \Nsuddenly helping people?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.69,0:16:46.75,Default,KIDS,0,0,0,,Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.75,0:16:48.06,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.47,0:16:50.96,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,What should we play today?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.96,0:16:54.57,italics,ZARETH,0,0,0,,She's having fun and smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.57,0:17:00.45,italics,ZARETH,0,0,0,,I was worried about her making friends, \Nbut I guess that was unnecessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.70,0:17:04.67,italics,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Humans and demons can see through \Ntheir differences and be friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.67,0:17:09.59,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Wait! She absolutely must \N{\i1}not{\i0} be friends with humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.59,0:17:13.59,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,You mustn't be like that, Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.89,0:17:17.05,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,This place will poison you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.05,0:17:19.25,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Never step foot in it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.25,0:17:20.18,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.18,0:17:21.68,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.32,0:17:28.94,italics,ZARETH,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I'm so sorry, Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.94,0:17:30.91,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Unnecessary! Unnecessary! Unnecessary!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.91,0:17:32.10,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,That's also unnecessary!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.10,0:17:34.19,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Unnecessary! Unnecessary! Unnecessary!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.19,0:17:37.57,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,This is all for your own sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.81,0:17:42.60,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Regarding your schedule for today,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.60,0:17:45.71,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,we will begin the celebration \Nfor you at ten in the great hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.71,0:17:49.96,top,JAHI,0,0,0,,His Majesty will do his opening speech, \Nthen the guests will say a few words,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.96,0:17:51.80,top,JAHI,0,0,0,,followed by the executive members,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.80,0:17:54.50,top,JAHI,0,0,0,,and then we will have you say \Na few words, Lord Zareth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.31,0:17:57.67,top,JAHI,0,0,0,,Then we will head over \Nto the great dining hall
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.67,0:18:01.40,top,JAHI,0,0,0,,to give a toast\N and then enjoy the banquet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.96,0:17:53.95,italics,ZARETH,0,0,0,,It's finally the day of \Nmy birthday celebration.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.95,0:17:58.84,italics,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Thank goodness. I won't be able\Nto keep it together much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.84,0:18:02.47,italics,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Once the festivities are \Nover, I'll go home at once...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.01,0:18:06.36,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.54,0:18:10.73,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Good morning, Pawpaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.22,0:18:14.34,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Pawpaw, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.34,0:18:17.93,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux has something she \Nwants to show you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.93,0:18:19.45,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,So please come to my room...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.45,0:18:22.62,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Have you been doing what \NI've told you to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.62,0:18:24.75,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.51,0:18:26.62,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,But, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.62,0:18:29.12,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Are you still going to \Ncome up with excuses?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.62,0:18:33.28,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,If you wish to speak with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.28,0:18:36.18,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,you must do everything I've \Nordered you to do first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.18,0:18:40.86,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,I have better things to do \Nthan play house with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.89,0:18:43.23,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Let us go, Jahi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.23,0:18:45.25,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.25,0:18:47.39,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,What? Are you going to \Ntalk back to me, as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.38,0:18:56.53,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,L-Lady Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.53,0:18:57.78,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Do not chase after her!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.99,0:18:59.78,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.78,0:19:00.78,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.29,0:19:09.64,Default,GAUCHE,0,0,0,,So that's Lord Zareth...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.64,0:19:11.50,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,He's really intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.55,0:19:23.39,Default,GAUCHE,0,0,0,,It's killing everyone's appetite...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.67,0:19:27.27,Default,URUN,0,0,0,,I heard that he'll kill \Nyou if you make him angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.27,0:19:28.78,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Where's Doux?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.78,0:19:31.27,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Huh?! Well, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.02,0:19:39.57,italics,ZARETH,0,0,0,,She hates me! Doux hates me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.57,0:19:42.31,italics,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Wait, why am I lamenting?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.31,0:19:45.62,italics,ZARETH,0,0,0,,I was prepared for this to happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.70,0:19:48.34,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,I am going to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.88,0:19:50.79,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lord Zareth!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.79,0:19:52.29,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Leave me be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.43,0:19:57.87,italics,ZARETH,0,0,0,,This is how it should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.87,0:20:02.43,italics,ZARETH,0,0,0,,So that she can cast aside her \Nkindness and survive as a demon...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.43,0:20:05.80,italics,ZARETH,0,0,0,,I had to set Doux on the right path.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.39,0:20:11.68,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,This is... Doux's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.83,0:20:16.81,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Doux?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.07,0:20:21.07,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,HAPPY BIRTHDAY PAWPAW!!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.07,0:20:23.57,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,HAPPY BIRTHDAY PAWPAW!!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.27,0:20:37.33,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Doux?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.09,0:20:43.34,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,HAPPY BIRTHDAY PAWPAW!!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.63,0:20:48.75,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Did you make all of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.75,0:20:49.85,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yup...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.85,0:20:55.03,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I wanted to surprise you because \Nit's your birthday today, Pawpaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.17,0:21:00.36,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,So I made this and didn't \Neven tell Papa or Big Sister Jahi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.86,0:21:04.61,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,But I'll make sure to \Nclean all this up, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.69,0:21:08.43,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I won't go on walks anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.43,0:21:12.87,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,and I won't... go see \Nthe humans as much...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.61,0:21:14.73,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.97,0:21:18.75,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I wanna talk with you more, Pawpaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.14,0:21:23.66,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.60,0:21:27.32,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,It's okay! It's okay, Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.32,0:21:31.96,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,You can change at your own pace \Nwithout having anyone hold you down!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.96,0:21:34.10,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Please forgive me, Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.78,0:21:38.32,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,I... I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.32,0:21:42.74,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,I've never received a gift \Nthat made me so happy before!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.00,0:21:47.80,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,This goes here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.80,0:21:48.96,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.96,0:21:52.83,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yup! I'll put one on you, too, Pawpaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.20,0:22:00.46,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Oh! Both of you, come help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.74,0:22:04.71,Default,ZARETH,0,0,0,,We'll have the rest of my birthday \Ncelebration in Doux's room!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.51,0:22:08.76,italics,ZARETH,0,0,0,,Having a grandchild is wonderful!
